{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30001_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e398adf12581c9f63fddc6e6f679290fad998927871bdc2b7c153d679ebb7172",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6277f9315fa3fe2c7a739d867b641c3ded4f1100cdd4a064bab1fc900889c129",
      "text": "哟，感谢你们今天能来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fc0bce1ffc78bc2e72358f843717bd82ca8c8353cd44a65aea69773d36a0d40",
      "text": "新婚快乐！\n该说谢谢的是我们，收到邀请真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4dcbadab7b1fc542e1500509c6732ae1bfbeb41ecea9af2555586c36f36aa110",
      "text": "不过，你居然也穿起无尾礼服了啊。\n真是佛要金装人要衣装呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47f91c8f35ae7c9437ca5a6a56c24e11f4bdab5faa719e2548001001334c2d1c",
      "text": "啰嗦，你不也一样嘛。\n穿得一身闪闪发光的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96f2f3cc39a90f93638ffedd4c3aade5909f60db0ee37b18cb15c1fd245d83fb",
      "text": "值此佳期，祝二位新婚快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75e310da3dc7b2bfaca63869ee2953704960114b108656bbe191fc06567035e4",
      "text": "恭喜二位！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ff879b5d3970c6e9fb7a43bf814bf37933619741b0c819c5343bad315778fa7",
      "text": "你们就是渡边结识的新伙伴吗……\n这家伙承蒙各位多方照顾了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63d4fc3d4c0aeff66b8806a353f48e2f7ca22ec90e75cc2f5162fdf748c84e0e",
      "text": "啊哈哈。干嘛露出那副感慨万千的表情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7387058b4b59c897c0b72898075c0e8c02ca56d4395a749b5303adb1a7f7d782",
      "text": "初次见面，实的朋友！\n我也是实的朋友，皮埃尔！还有这位是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c28271d9062a887b3724274ce4ef7007e42e296556c032e38416c5137621cc4a",
      "text": "我是鹰城恭二。\n那个……今天我们会全力献上祝福的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30001_01:1_3_30001_01_e:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adf04c54cfa07ccc8e2b32765996fb2befa2a3a17fcf00e866d3862d3b9795ca",
      "text": "啊，多谢啦！\n渡边，致辞和唱歌我都满心期待着呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
